      "instance_name": "gang_of_four_scene",
      "label": "the gang of four scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting four women standing side by side, with overlaid text sarcastically rebranding them as 'the gang of four' instead of 'the squad'. The women are positioned in a row, facing forward with slight variations in their gazes and expressions. The scene is framed to emphasize their collective presence and the textual commentary on their group identity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
